  "id": "dynamogenesis",
  "term": "dynamogenesis",
  "definition": "Dynamogenesis is the principle that changes in sensory stimulation are reflected in corresponding changes in muscular tension or movement. In psychological terms, it was also used for the idea that changes in sensory consciousness tend to be followed by changes in motor consciousness.",
